Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去告诉乔伊你回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I'm gonna go tell Joey that you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚才好担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were really worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.18,0:21:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她信了吗   确信无疑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, did she buy it? Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希蒂有带你参观场地了吗  有  美仑美奂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did Hildy show you the place? Yeah. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你居然要跟摩妮卡求婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you're gonna ask Monica to marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:22.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.58,0:21:36.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿甘  把这些卡布奇诺瑞到11号桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Gunther. Take these cappuccinos to Table 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:38.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个男的点了小甜饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that guy over there wants some biscotti.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.83,0:21:42.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是要外带一杯咖啡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Well, I just actually came in for a cup of coffee to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.21,0:21:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在这里上班吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you still work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.26,0:21:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我早就不做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. I quit a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了通知你   抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I forget to tell you that? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  反正我也打算开除你  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's cool, I was gonna fire you anyway. Great.
